1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,951
yet there never was a man
who deserved punishment more.

2
00:00:04,944 --> 00:00:08,396
This matter, from what you say, seems
to have been a shock to her also.

3
00:00:09,068 --> 00:00:11,802
He was trying to utter
the name of his murderer.

4
00:00:12,975 --> 00:00:15,435
Oh, Anstruther would
do your work for you.

5
00:00:15,722 --> 00:00:19,207
If you can do nothing better than
laugh at me, I can go elsewhere.

6
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:21,837
But what, then, did the gipsies do?

7
00:00:22,306 --> 00:00:23,770
You see this little book?
